        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Royal Flash (film), Royal Flash (novel)\n- People: George MacDonald Fraser, Oliver Reed, Alan Bates, Florinda Bolkan, Otto von Bismarck\n- Roles: Otto von Bismarck, Rudi von Sternberg, Lola Montez\n- Topics: Prussian statesmanship, German and European affairs\n\nFacts:\n- Otto von Bismarck was born on 1 April 1815 and died on 30 July 1898.\n- Otto von Bismarck was a conservative Prussian statesman who dominated German and European affairs from the 1860s until 1890.\n- Royal Flash is a 1975 film based on George MacDonald Fraser's second Flashman novel, Royal Flash.\n- In Royal Flash, Oliver Reed played Otto von Bismarck, Alan Bates played Rudi von Sternberg, and Florinda Bolkan played Lola Montez.",
